The current `agent` accepts `--frames <directory>` and polls for live screenshots. I’m going to make the minimal coherent refactor: `--frame <video>` becomes the agent input, a reusable Rust extractor writes ordered PNGs to a specified directory through `ffmpeg`, and the agent consumes those extracted frames sequentially instead of waiting for directory changes.
